      "description": "Cross-platform performance report with normalized metrics (spend, clicks, conversions, ROAS, ...). Rows are capped by `limit`; the response says when it truncated. Use summary.groups for currency-separated totals and spend-weighted ROAS; never average row ratios or combine currencies. Null metrics are unavailable. Use granularity=day for real daily observations, up to 31 days; this makes one report read per provider per day.",
